<p>Not bad. I like the concept, and the execution overall was pretty good. One thing I'd perhaps recommend is finding another way to format the actions in the interview logs, especially towards the end of the second the bold just gives off the wrong tone for me. But, that's a very subjective stylistic thing.</p>
<p>There isn't anything I can say that is explicitly wrong with it (maybe try to remove blackboxes? they usually add nothing but ugliness to an article), but there's just this overall feeling I get from the story that makes it somewhat&#8230; underwhelming. It's difficult for me to describe.</p>
<p>Even so, this skates just into upvote territory for now.</p>
<p>P.S. Because Macleod already did his own self-promotey thing, I feel perfectly justified in saying that this drone and <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-2548">the vacuum</a> should meet up sometime.</p>

